WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:31.430 --> 01:40.120
[Song of the Moon]

01:40.120 --> 01:42.990
[Episode 6]

01:45.500 --> 01:48.400
[Pearl Pavilion]

01:55.160 --> 01:55.840
Damn fish demon,

01:55.840 --> 01:57.640
come here, come here, come here.

01:59.910 --> 02:01.460
How is Master?

02:02.930 --> 02:03.860
He is very quiet.

02:04.070 --> 02:04.990
Except sleeping,

02:04.990 --> 02:06.500
he spends most of the time playing in the Code

02:06.500 --> 02:07.700
and rarely comes out.

02:08.979 --> 02:09.479
Okay.

02:11.500 --> 02:13.310
Please keep an eye on him for me.

02:13.890 --> 02:15.110
If anything happens,

02:15.110 --> 02:16.040
just let me know.

02:16.460 --> 02:17.130
Thank you.

02:18.090 --> 02:19.100
Lu Li.

02:21.870 --> 02:23.010
Didn't Liu Shao

02:23.010 --> 02:24.210
mention when to let me

02:24.520 --> 02:25.700
go back?

02:31.110 --> 02:32.910
Are you in such a hurry to go back?

02:33.680 --> 02:34.890
Even if you are

02:35.400 --> 02:36.990
at the risk of being discovered.

02:36.990 --> 02:38.130
Miss Liu Shao said that

02:38.130 --> 02:39.350
I was her demon.

02:41.160 --> 02:42.160
You are her demon?

02:43.170 --> 02:44.610
I'm her man.

02:47.829 --> 02:48.630
What's wrong?

02:52.200 --> 02:53.000
Is he...

02:55.010 --> 02:56.270
I mean

02:56.560 --> 02:58.030
the man protecting her.

02:59.710 --> 03:00.910
You must not know that

03:01.180 --> 03:03.030
I received 30,000 taels of silver from her.

03:03.030 --> 03:05.690
I must be responsible for everything about her.

03:07.360 --> 03:08.280
Everything?

03:11.770 --> 03:12.860
I mean,

03:13.200 --> 03:14.120
I need to let her live safely

03:14.120 --> 03:16.050
in Marquis Wuyang's Mansion.

03:16.050 --> 03:18.579
Who's responsible for the missing King Herb?

03:18.740 --> 03:20.270
You are responsible for it.

03:21.430 --> 03:24.560
Your master, Demon King in White, is responsible for it.

03:45.280 --> 03:46.590
Bai Feng,

03:46.590 --> 03:47.470
the night patrol disciples

03:47.470 --> 03:50.110
who are responsible for the northwest woods are not back yet.

03:50.110 --> 03:51.210
You two keep patrolling.

03:51.210 --> 03:52.140
I'll take a look.

04:53.030 --> 04:54.330
I remember you.

04:55.340 --> 04:56.970
Lu Li is your junior.

04:57.310 --> 04:58.280
Ao Hen,

04:58.780 --> 05:00.630
kill me if you want.

05:00.630 --> 05:02.010
Cut the crap.

05:04.070 --> 05:06.530
What matters is that I don't want to kill you.

05:07.140 --> 05:08.860
I want to cooperate with you.

05:09.740 --> 05:12.930
I recover my strength by absorbing spirit.

05:12.930 --> 05:14.570
You can help me.

05:15.030 --> 05:16.970
As Marquis Wuyang's disciple,

05:16.970 --> 05:19.230
how can I cooperate with a demon like you?

05:19.230 --> 05:21.120
Don't worry.

05:21.120 --> 05:22.970
To show my sincerity,

05:23.600 --> 05:26.040
I'll give you a big gift first.

05:26.040 --> 05:28.140
There's an Aquatic Demon

05:28.560 --> 05:30.620
in Marquis Wuyang's Mansion.

05:31.330 --> 05:32.800
So what?

05:32.800 --> 05:34.980
Aquatic Demons are elites.

05:35.450 --> 05:37.180
We can't arrest them as we want.

05:38.510 --> 05:40.650
Let me give you another suggestion.

05:40.650 --> 05:42.460
When you arrest him,

05:42.460 --> 05:44.220
don't let him get any water.

05:46.280 --> 05:47.960
When it's done,

05:48.800 --> 05:50.610
you can come to me again.

05:51.610 --> 05:53.460
I am leaving, little girl.

05:56.400 --> 05:57.830
Little girl,

05:58.420 --> 06:01.060
you have a lot of discontents.

06:01.440 --> 06:03.120
But since you're so weak,

06:03.120 --> 06:05.100
you can't get

06:05.100 --> 06:06.860
what you want.

06:11.230 --> 06:13.370
Soul-Devouring Spell works like this.

06:13.370 --> 06:14.970
Is there any solution?

06:17.360 --> 06:18.490
Why does it work again?

06:18.490 --> 06:20.640
If you fall in love with Liu Shao,

06:21.180 --> 06:23.700
Soul-Devouring Spell will be triggered.

06:24.080 --> 06:27.940
It will make your blood vessels expand oppositely and cause you pain.

06:31.850 --> 06:32.730
No.

06:33.280 --> 06:36.480
I have to find a way to suppress the Soul-Devouring Spell.

06:40.000 --> 06:42.980
When the spell returns to your palm,

06:43.780 --> 06:45.580
you will die.

06:46.210 --> 06:47.890
If that's the case,

06:48.480 --> 06:50.500
I can only avoid meeting Liu Shao.

06:55.580 --> 06:59.400
[Marquis Wuyang's Mansion]

07:07.550 --> 07:08.470
One day,

07:10.240 --> 07:11.410
two days,

07:16.490 --> 07:17.250
three days.

07:17.250 --> 07:17.920
Liu Shao.

07:18.680 --> 07:20.650
Why are you sitting here for so long?

07:20.650 --> 07:21.530
Four days.

07:25.190 --> 07:26.570
I'm counting the days

07:26.570 --> 07:28.130
when I haven't seen Lu Li

07:28.130 --> 07:30.230
after leaving Pearl Pavilion,

07:31.570 --> 07:33.080
I wonder

07:33.080 --> 07:34.470
what he's doing now.

07:34.470 --> 07:35.390
Boss,

07:35.860 --> 07:38.659
you asked me to let Liu Shao and the demon meet more.

07:38.880 --> 07:40.610
Do you want them to be together?

07:41.310 --> 07:42.830
I always think that you and Liu Shao

07:42.830 --> 07:44.490
are the most suitable couple.

07:46.060 --> 07:47.450
Are you alright?

07:48.159 --> 07:49.800
Stop talking nonsense.

07:50.220 --> 07:51.350
Liu Shao and I are...

07:52.400 --> 07:53.580
We are just...

07:54.960 --> 07:57.020
There is only employment between us.

07:59.250 --> 08:00.000
That's all.

08:00.930 --> 08:03.070
Boss, who are you lying to?

08:03.450 --> 08:04.750
You're double-faced.

08:09.870 --> 08:10.880
Anyway,

08:11.390 --> 08:13.230
I have my own ideas.

08:13.230 --> 08:14.620
You figure this out.

08:15.540 --> 08:17.600
Don't let Liu Shao approach me again.

08:19.370 --> 08:20.440
Yes, boss.

08:20.470 --> 08:21.890
I understand what you mean.

08:21.890 --> 08:23.610
You just don't want Liu Shao to bother you.

08:23.610 --> 08:24.240
Don't worry.

08:24.240 --> 08:24.830
Leave it to me.

08:24.830 --> 08:25.830
I will get it done.

08:34.950 --> 08:37.000
Why is Lu Li avoiding meeting me lately?

08:37.000 --> 08:37.679
Tell me.

08:37.970 --> 08:39.650
Will you die if you tell me the truth?

08:39.650 --> 08:40.570
Tell me.

08:41.120 --> 08:42.169
Why do you like to punch me in the chest

08:42.169 --> 08:44.270
like my boss?

08:44.270 --> 08:44.860
You...

08:46.330 --> 08:48.680
Will you tell me the truth?

08:48.680 --> 08:49.440
Will you?

08:51.330 --> 08:52.080
I...

08:55.950 --> 08:56.830
Listen,

08:57.120 --> 08:58.050
I will never

08:58.630 --> 08:59.600
betray my boss.

09:06.400 --> 09:07.960
You're quite loyal.

09:10.390 --> 09:11.320
Xue,

09:11.940 --> 09:13.170
why don't you give the cake you made

09:13.170 --> 09:15.640
to Senior Xu

09:15.640 --> 09:17.160
and Senior Wan?

09:18.290 --> 09:20.260
They love it too.

09:20.260 --> 09:21.400
After all,

09:21.400 --> 09:24.210
Senior Xu is handsome

09:24.210 --> 09:26.820
and Senior Wan is good at sword fighting.

09:26.820 --> 09:29.630
They are both better than this fatty.

09:30.640 --> 09:31.730
No, no, no.

09:32.440 --> 09:33.160
Okay.

09:33.950 --> 09:34.750
Go.

09:34.750 --> 09:35.260
Xue...

09:36.600 --> 09:37.520
Xue.

09:37.820 --> 09:38.950
Do you want to say it?

09:41.600 --> 09:43.240
I'll tell you, okay?

09:51.050 --> 09:53.510
The Soul-Devouring Spell is getting worse.

09:54.700 --> 09:56.090
It's not a good idea

09:56.680 --> 09:58.280
to keep hiding from Liu Shao.

10:03.860 --> 10:04.780
Lu Li.

10:10.490 --> 10:11.330
Senior,

10:11.920 --> 10:12.430
you...

10:12.890 --> 10:14.060
what's up?

10:15.110 --> 10:16.880
You don't look well.

10:16.880 --> 10:18.280
Are you not feeling well?

10:18.640 --> 10:19.440
I'm fine.

10:19.730 --> 10:20.700
I am just

10:20.990 --> 10:21.920
tired from practicing.

10:21.920 --> 10:22.720
I'm fine.

10:24.650 --> 10:25.400
By the way,

10:25.400 --> 10:27.290
I found this

10:27.290 --> 10:28.340
on the window of the wall nearby.

10:28.340 --> 10:29.180
I hope

10:30.060 --> 10:31.370
that person is you.

10:32.330 --> 10:33.660
Will you be that person?

10:35.570 --> 10:36.360
Senior,

10:37.580 --> 10:39.810
I gave this sound-leaving stone to Liu Shao.

10:39.810 --> 10:41.140
Why did you take it away?

10:42.580 --> 10:43.550
Liu Shao?

10:44.300 --> 10:45.690
I thought it was for me.

10:45.690 --> 10:47.070
Can't I touch it?

10:47.070 --> 10:48.540
This concerns Liu Shao...

10:48.540 --> 10:49.090
Do you know...

10:49.090 --> 10:50.640
Do you like Liu Shao that much?

10:50.640 --> 10:52.240
I thought there shouldn't be so many concerns

10:52.240 --> 10:53.710
in our relationship.

10:59.840 --> 11:00.640
Lu Li,

11:01.900 --> 11:03.870
Your spiritual power and hers are born to be opposing.

11:03.870 --> 11:05.870
You are destined not to be together.

11:06.520 --> 11:07.950
If you insist,

11:07.950 --> 11:09.590
if Master finds it out,

11:09.590 --> 11:11.270
he won't let Liu Shao go.

11:22.940 --> 11:25.540
You have a lot of discontents.

11:25.880 --> 11:27.430
But since you're so weak,

11:27.730 --> 11:29.620
you can't get

11:29.620 --> 11:31.340
what you want

11:35.080 --> 11:36.010
What did you say?

11:36.210 --> 11:37.670
What did He Na apply to her?

11:38.650 --> 11:39.490
A kind of flower tea.

11:39.490 --> 11:41.460
The white datura tea under the Shorea robusta.

11:41.460 --> 11:42.890
He even got a master to cast a spell of recognizing master.

11:42.890 --> 11:44.190
She will fall in love with the first person she sees at first sight

11:44.190 --> 11:46.500
after she takes off the blindfold.

11:47.510 --> 11:49.320
And...

11:49.320 --> 11:51.750
and...

11:51.750 --> 11:54.400
Didn't you tell me not to let Liu Shao think about you?

11:54.400 --> 11:57.800
I asked them to play hide-and-seek. As long as she sees Aho...

12:06.120 --> 12:08.300
Oh no, Soul-Devouring Spell...

12:11.530 --> 12:12.420
Liu Shao.

12:17.790 --> 12:21.740
[Pearl Pavilion]

13:01.090 --> 13:01.720
Liu Shao,

13:02.310 --> 13:03.150
are you okay?

13:07.940 --> 13:08.820
Oh no.

13:10.040 --> 13:11.170
If she sees me,

13:11.680 --> 13:13.270
will she...?

13:16.460 --> 13:17.430
Lu Li,

13:17.430 --> 13:18.900
do you really think that

13:18.920 --> 13:20.790
I drank that so-called

13:20.790 --> 13:22.260
datura tea?

13:24.060 --> 13:25.070
I was just kidding.

13:25.070 --> 13:26.000
Come out.

13:26.960 --> 13:28.100
Kidding?

13:30.410 --> 13:32.670
That was a show I asked Fattie and He Na to play with me.

13:32.670 --> 13:33.930
You tricked me!

13:35.700 --> 13:36.710
Bad Fattie.

13:36.710 --> 13:38.840
I'll teach him a lesson when I get back.

13:40.020 --> 13:41.280
I'll teach you a lesson.

13:41.280 --> 13:42.040
Why?

13:42.040 --> 13:44.010
Why did you avoid meeting me? Why?

13:45.230 --> 13:47.800
♫This is a spring song♫

13:48.510 --> 13:49.180
I...

13:48.970 --> 13:51.450
♫The peach blossoms fly with the swallow♫

13:52.540 --> 13:57.640
♫Whose lights are light and shine people's way home?♫

13:53.460 --> 13:55.140
Actually, I was not...

13:55.140 --> 13:56.700
I was secretly investigating He Na.

13:56.700 --> 13:57.200
He...

13:58.970 --> 14:00.100
In fact, he's not a little demon underneath

13:59.880 --> 14:02.570
♫The clouds roll the sunset♫

14:00.100 --> 14:01.320
Demon King in White

14:01.320 --> 14:02.650
but Demon King in White.

14:03.650 --> 14:06.110
♫The moon kisses the eyebrows♫

14:04.640 --> 14:06.150
So he is...

14:06.110 --> 14:08.330
♫I am waiting for you to say♫

14:06.480 --> 14:08.420
the one who stole my King Herb.

14:08.330 --> 14:12.350
♫Tonight in this life♫

14:09.090 --> 14:09.550
Yes.

14:10.150 --> 14:12.910
He, the robber, approached you with an ulterior motive.

14:12.910 --> 14:14.380
He pretended to be injured and was picked up by you.

14:13.250 --> 14:17.160
♫Ask the flowing water whether it knows the red leaves♫

14:16.270 --> 14:18.540
I was thinking that he still has King Herb,

14:17.160 --> 14:20.740
♫I miss you so much♫

14:18.910 --> 14:20.220
so I investigated him secretly

14:20.220 --> 14:21.430
to get King Herb back.

14:20.740 --> 14:23.220
♫I still remember the youth♫

14:23.980 --> 14:27.330
♫I laughed and hated getting old♫

14:28.100 --> 14:30.930
♫Flowers bloom alone. The fragrance fills the path♫

14:29.200 --> 14:30.460
So,

14:30.930 --> 14:32.860
♫Look at the stars from faraway♫

14:32.350 --> 14:33.660
you did it for me

14:33.220 --> 14:35.540
♫The chaos of knowing love♫

14:35.540 --> 14:38.350
♫The South Wind folds a little red♫

14:38.690 --> 14:41.830
♫Send you to the Western State♫

14:42.100 --> 14:42.940
How is it?

14:42.960 --> 14:45.720
♫Wild geese pass the mountains and the sea♫

14:43.480 --> 14:45.080
After you know the truth now,

14:45.370 --> 14:46.380
do you think that

14:45.720 --> 14:48.020
♫I am rushing to a dream♫

14:46.380 --> 14:47.350
your brother Lu Li

14:47.350 --> 14:48.190
is very wise

14:48.020 --> 14:50.260
♫The fate of three lifetimes♫

14:48.730 --> 14:50.130
and you admire me so much?

14:50.260 --> 14:51.270
♫Appreciate with our hands tied♫

14:51.270 --> 14:57.130
♫Thousands of paths with flowers♫

14:51.550 --> 14:52.980
You are not wise at all!

14:53.350 --> 14:54.530
You deliberately avoided meeting me. I was pissed off,

14:54.530 --> 14:55.410
so I beat Fattie up.

14:55.410 --> 14:57.050
Now I want to beat you up too.

14:57.050 --> 14:58.600
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

14:58.600 --> 14:59.070
I...

14:59.780 --> 15:01.540
I was just afraid that you would reveal it.

15:01.540 --> 15:02.970
Anyway, it's my fault.

15:02.970 --> 15:04.360
It's wrong to hide it from you.

15:04.360 --> 15:05.660
I'm sad, too. I...

15:08.680 --> 15:09.820
What can you do?

15:13.220 --> 15:14.180
I can be sad.

15:17.960 --> 15:18.720
Fine.

15:20.400 --> 15:21.320
But

15:21.320 --> 15:22.840
the Demon King He Na

15:22.840 --> 15:24.810
doesn't look like a bad person.

15:25.860 --> 15:27.040
I need to ask him.

15:27.540 --> 15:29.220
Since he has gotten King Herb,

15:29.680 --> 15:32.500
why did he take the risk to come to Marquis Wuyang's Mansion?

15:32.500 --> 15:33.340
Do you want to

15:33.760 --> 15:35.440
go by yourself? Maybe...

15:39.260 --> 15:39.850
Nothing.

15:40.350 --> 15:42.110
I'll send you out.

16:25.790 --> 16:28.940
[Pearl Pavilion]

16:37.720 --> 16:40.180
Lu Li told me that you were not a little demon.

16:44.860 --> 16:45.830
Yes.

16:46.710 --> 16:49.310
I am the Demon King of the Aquatic Demons, He Na.

16:51.030 --> 16:52.630
Because I am always in white,

16:52.800 --> 16:54.530
I am called Demon King in White.

17:01.490 --> 17:03.260
Did you rob King Herb?

17:05.190 --> 17:05.990
That's right.

17:06.609 --> 17:07.619
I'm sorry.

17:08.250 --> 17:10.140
King Herb has been used by our clan.

17:10.140 --> 17:12.160
I'll remember your kindness.

17:12.160 --> 17:13.210
I will repay you in the future.

17:13.210 --> 17:14.339
No, King...

17:14.339 --> 17:16.190
Is King Herb really gone?

17:17.410 --> 17:18.540
It's true.

17:19.210 --> 17:20.349
I robbed the King Herb

17:20.349 --> 17:21.690
to save people.

17:22.660 --> 17:24.250
Then why did you come back?

17:29.130 --> 17:31.020
I want a drop of blood from you.

17:32.400 --> 17:33.580
My blood?

17:37.400 --> 17:38.070
Oh.

17:54.540 --> 17:55.960
Why don't you ask why?

17:56.890 --> 17:58.190
I believe you have your own reason

17:58.190 --> 17:59.660
for doing this.

18:02.350 --> 18:03.480
I have a lot of blood.

18:03.860 --> 18:05.120
Do you trust me so much?

18:06.210 --> 18:07.300
Of course, I trust you.

18:07.300 --> 18:08.810
Because you are my demon.

18:44.010 --> 18:44.980
What?

18:50.140 --> 18:51.490
I thought Miss Liu Shao

18:51.490 --> 18:53.620
is the destined one to Aquatic Demons.

18:54.300 --> 18:55.900
Unfortunately, I was wrong.

18:57.870 --> 18:59.130
But it's good.

18:59.510 --> 19:00.930
What?

19:02.870 --> 19:03.580
Nothing.

19:04.380 --> 19:06.510
You're not the person I'm looking for.

19:07.190 --> 19:07.910
Oh.

19:09.630 --> 19:10.340
Well,

19:11.430 --> 19:12.650
let's say goodbye.

19:13.790 --> 19:15.300
I'm sorry about King Herb.

19:15.840 --> 19:17.770
I will find a way to make it up to you.

19:18.200 --> 19:20.130
As for why I'm here,

19:21.220 --> 19:23.190
it's not the best time to tell you.

19:24.750 --> 19:25.380
Fine.

19:29.200 --> 19:30.500
Get in!

19:30.500 --> 19:31.760
Do as I say.

19:31.760 --> 19:33.020
Don't waste a moment.

19:33.020 --> 19:33.780
Yes.

19:35.370 --> 19:36.210
Well,

19:36.210 --> 19:37.350
you hide first.

19:45.120 --> 19:47.680
An evil demon has come to the Pearl Pavilion.

19:48.020 --> 19:49.230
All disciples outside,

19:49.230 --> 19:50.660
set an Elixir Sand Formation!

19:50.660 --> 19:52.190
Don't let the demon escape.

19:53.010 --> 19:55.210
How did he know that He Na is hiding here?

19:58.180 --> 19:59.140
I'm the only one here.

19:59.140 --> 20:00.280
There is no demon.

20:00.700 --> 20:01.790
Junior Liu Shao,

20:01.790 --> 20:02.970
I'm really sorry.

20:02.970 --> 20:03.760
I

20:03.760 --> 20:05.220
am just following orders.

20:06.750 --> 20:09.310
You don't look well.

20:09.730 --> 20:11.950
I didn't hear that you were sick.

20:15.780 --> 20:16.910
Tell me.

20:16.910 --> 20:18.590
Where did you hide the demon?

20:18.090 --> 20:21.780
[Pearl Pavilion]

20:19.560 --> 20:20.440
Du,

20:20.440 --> 20:21.840
we didn't find the demon.

20:26.740 --> 20:27.620
I have told you that

20:27.620 --> 20:28.620
there was only me.

20:29.220 --> 20:30.420
Do you believe me now?

20:33.000 --> 20:34.930
If you continue to hide,

20:34.930 --> 20:36.990
I will kill your friend with my sword.

20:41.060 --> 20:42.450
Didn't I ask you to hide in the "Magic Plant Code" and

20:42.450 --> 20:43.410
not to come out?

20:43.410 --> 20:45.090
I'm fine. Hide yourself.

20:45.090 --> 20:47.530
Otherwise, you may be noticed and get stewed.

20:47.530 --> 20:49.040
I said that there was only me.

20:49.040 --> 20:49.960
Du Mingchong,

20:49.960 --> 20:51.350
this is Marquis Wuyang's mansion.

20:51.350 --> 20:52.990
You can't mess around here.

20:52.990 --> 20:53.910
Really?

20:53.910 --> 20:56.090
You collude with the Demon Realm with evil intentions.

20:56.090 --> 20:57.060
Even if I kill you,

20:57.060 --> 20:58.740
Master won't blame me.

20:59.960 --> 21:01.300
Junior Liu Shao,

21:01.300 --> 21:02.730
I'm really sorry.

21:04.790 --> 21:06.050
My friend,

21:06.050 --> 21:07.520
if you don't come out,

21:08.110 --> 21:11.090
Liu Shao will die because of you.

21:23.810 --> 21:25.540
She doesn't know that I'm hiding here

21:25.540 --> 21:27.050
and she is not my friend.

21:27.850 --> 21:29.250
You are an Aquatic Demon.

21:29.570 --> 21:31.120
Demon, die!

21:38.720 --> 21:40.050
Don't hit my fish demon!

21:44.440 --> 21:45.150
Liu Shao!

22:01.230 --> 22:01.950
Fire Whip!

22:09.470 --> 22:10.470
Stop!

22:26.390 --> 22:27.190
Who are you?

22:28.110 --> 22:30.130
I come from Xiyin Mountain.

22:32.270 --> 22:33.570
Xiyin Mountain?

22:33.570 --> 22:34.880
He wears a mask...

22:34.880 --> 22:36.770
Is he the head disciple of the Immortal Master Wanwu,

22:36.770 --> 22:38.910
the most talented lord in Immortal Palace, Lord Wuxiang,

22:38.910 --> 22:39.620
Luo Ge?

22:43.570 --> 22:44.660
It is impossible.

22:45.790 --> 22:47.600
Immortal Palace is condescending.

22:47.600 --> 22:49.910
It doesn't even want to send a fairy here.

22:50.200 --> 22:52.980
How can Lord Wuxiang come in person?

22:53.480 --> 22:54.680
Don't you believe me?

22:54.990 --> 22:57.010
If you are Lord Wuxiang,

22:57.010 --> 22:58.690
please show your power.

23:03.270 --> 23:04.020
He

23:04.900 --> 23:07.300
is the one Xiyin Mountain wants to protect.

23:14.560 --> 23:17.500
It's the first time I've heard that a lord appeared to protect demons.

23:17.500 --> 23:20.560
Why does Xiyin Mountain want to protect a little demon?

23:22.960 --> 23:24.480
When does Xiyin Mountain

23:25.110 --> 23:26.790
need to explain to you?

23:28.170 --> 23:29.180
And Liu Shao

23:30.310 --> 23:31.830
is also someone I value.

23:32.880 --> 23:35.410
No one is allowed to make it difficult for her.

23:45.940 --> 23:46.730
It's him.

23:46.730 --> 23:48.750
Lord is so powerful

23:48.750 --> 23:52.610
that you even know the name of a disciple in Marquis Wuyang's Mansion.

23:53.370 --> 23:55.680
Please show us your power.

23:57.740 --> 23:59.170
You don't deserve it.

24:08.150 --> 24:08.880
Come with me.

24:11.090 --> 24:15.130
[Pearl Pavilion]

24:11.510 --> 24:12.560
He is a liar.

24:12.560 --> 24:13.740
He's not a lord.

24:13.740 --> 24:14.410
We've been tricked.

24:14.410 --> 24:14.920
Chase them!

24:14.920 --> 24:15.340
Go!

24:19.030 --> 24:21.300
Hurry up!

24:21.990 --> 24:22.820
Hurry up.

24:32.090 --> 24:33.950
Help me untie it. Help me untie it.

24:37.550 --> 24:39.400
Bad news, boss.

24:40.370 --> 24:41.460
Slow down!

24:41.460 --> 24:42.760
Boss, bad news!

24:42.760 --> 24:44.020
Why are you in a hurry?

24:44.020 --> 24:45.490
No. Bai Feng and Du Mingchong

24:45.490 --> 24:47.690
went to Pearl Pavilion to catch demons.

24:47.880 --> 24:49.100
I heard that as soon as they got to the Pearl Pavilion,

24:49.100 --> 24:50.870
they smashed everything.

24:50.870 --> 24:51.870
Those with water

24:51.870 --> 24:53.260
were all smashed.

24:53.260 --> 24:54.310
No water was left.

24:54.310 --> 24:56.310
Yes. Even the fish tank was smashed.

24:58.430 --> 25:00.400
He Na's power is weakened without water

25:00.400 --> 25:01.930
and he can't use much magic.

25:02.290 --> 25:03.510
Someone knows his weakness

25:03.510 --> 25:04.350
and wants to kill him.

25:04.350 --> 25:05.350
What should we do?

25:06.150 --> 25:06.880
Let me think.

25:07.790 --> 25:08.670
Little demon,

25:08.670 --> 25:09.640
in order to save you,

25:09.640 --> 25:11.700
I took out my best magic weapons.

25:11.700 --> 25:13.300
How are you going to thank me?

25:13.420 --> 25:14.720
Why do you

25:14.720 --> 25:17.320
have the costume of Lord Wuxiang for no reason?

25:17.830 --> 25:18.840
Do you mean this?

25:20.140 --> 25:22.490
I used these when I cheated...

25:24.590 --> 25:25.430
No, no, no.

25:26.440 --> 25:28.960
I used these when I helped others.

25:28.960 --> 25:30.360
These are not important.

25:30.890 --> 25:31.980
Anyway,

25:31.980 --> 25:33.410
you owe me a favor.

25:33.870 --> 25:34.840
Yes.

25:34.840 --> 25:37.320
Aquatic Demons owe Lu Li and Liu Shao a big favor.

25:37.320 --> 25:38.920
I'll repay you in the future.

25:39.370 --> 25:40.130
No need.

25:40.130 --> 25:41.310
You're welcome.

25:41.310 --> 25:43.660
I can't repay Liu Shao for the time being.

25:43.990 --> 25:45.000
But maybe

25:45.550 --> 25:46.610
I can do you a favor.

25:47.100 --> 25:48.910
Are you under some kind of spell?

25:54.870 --> 25:56.380
Announce the order of Marquis Wuyang.

25:56.380 --> 25:57.350
All disciples

25:57.350 --> 25:59.070
come to the Moon Platform immediately.

25:59.070 --> 26:00.080
I heard that

26:00.080 --> 26:02.390
the Lord who suddenly appeared was fake.

26:02.390 --> 26:03.730
That's why my Lord

26:03.730 --> 26:05.330
comes to the Moon Platform to identify the identity.

26:05.330 --> 26:07.140
Is Lord going to invite the lords in the Immortal Palace?

26:07.140 --> 26:08.520
Even my Lord doesn't know it.

26:08.520 --> 26:10.380
Is that Lord Wuxiang really fake?

26:10.500 --> 26:12.600
How dare he cheated

26:12.600 --> 26:14.400
in Marquis Wuyang's Mansion?

26:19.400 --> 26:21.130
You pretended to be him, right?

26:22.680 --> 26:25.240
Pretending to be Lord... Do you want to die?

26:25.240 --> 26:26.620
Don't worry.

26:26.620 --> 26:29.350
If anything happens, I'll take responsibility.

26:30.780 --> 26:32.110
Marquis Wuyang is here.

26:35.400 --> 26:36.490
I heard that

26:36.490 --> 26:39.820
an envoy of Immortal Palace, Lord Wuxiang, came here today,

26:40.020 --> 26:41.280
but he didn't meet me

26:41.570 --> 26:42.040
Stop pinching.

26:42.040 --> 26:43.100
and left in a hurry.

26:43.340 --> 26:45.540
I would be bruised if you kept pinching.

26:54.220 --> 26:56.880
I don't want to suspect it, but it's too strange.

27:00.850 --> 27:03.920
I must ask the Immortal Palace about it.

27:09.630 --> 27:10.970
Mirror Xuantian

27:10.970 --> 27:12.400
tells the difference.

27:24.160 --> 27:25.420
Marquis Wu Yang,

27:25.420 --> 27:28.230
I've seen the video

27:28.230 --> 27:30.160
you sent through Mirror Xuantian.

27:30.500 --> 27:33.270
I also need to investigate and see

27:33.270 --> 27:35.920
whether the person behind the mask is true or not.

27:35.920 --> 27:38.480
Please check his identity.

27:56.840 --> 27:59.310
Is this the Immortal Wanwu you mentioned?

28:00.950 --> 28:03.600
[Chief of Palace Wuji, Immortal Wanwu]

28:03.600 --> 28:04.520
Something big must have happened.

28:04.520 --> 28:05.780
Immortal Wanwu comes here in person.

28:05.780 --> 28:08.010
Is the fake one among us?

28:09.390 --> 28:11.030
Among us?

28:15.270 --> 28:16.240
Oh no.

28:16.240 --> 28:16.910
This...

28:16.910 --> 28:18.130
This is really over.

28:18.130 --> 28:19.350
Shut up.

28:42.610 --> 28:44.140
He can't be counted as fake.

29:07.560 --> 29:08.360
Your Majesty,

29:09.070 --> 29:09.830
how is it?

29:10.540 --> 29:11.870
I have investigated it.

29:12.310 --> 29:13.310
She isn't the one.

29:16.720 --> 29:17.770
She isn't...

29:20.660 --> 29:22.850
Your Majesty, don't be too sad.

29:24.070 --> 29:26.420
After all, 10 thousand years have passed.

29:26.840 --> 29:28.390
It's not that easy

29:28.390 --> 29:29.780
to find that person.

29:30.950 --> 29:31.920
I thought

29:32.720 --> 29:35.320
even if she's not the person we're looking for,

29:35.490 --> 29:37.380
I must find a chance to repay her.

29:40.990 --> 29:43.390
I took away King Herb she worked hard to find

29:46.580 --> 29:48.090
and put her in danger.

29:51.280 --> 29:52.940
I want a drop of blood from you.

29:53.340 --> 29:53.680
Oh.

29:57.290 --> 29:58.550
Do you trust me so much?

29:59.470 --> 30:00.400
Of course, I trust you.

30:00.400 --> 30:01.800
Because you are my demon.

30:03.000 --> 30:04.600
But after knowing the truth,

30:06.230 --> 30:08.090
she still treated me as her friend

30:08.460 --> 30:09.800
and protected me.

30:11.530 --> 30:12.660
I didn't expect that

30:13.500 --> 30:14.840
I would owe her more.

30:18.960 --> 30:19.920
Your Majesty,

30:19.920 --> 30:22.520
someone named Lu Li is looking for you outside.

30:28.530 --> 30:30.550
Are you under any spell?

30:31.140 --> 30:32.820
Aquatic Demons have long been plagued by spells,

30:32.820 --> 30:33.950
so I know a little about it.

30:33.950 --> 30:35.210
Maybe I can help you.

30:36.090 --> 30:37.560
Can He Na really help me?

30:40.170 --> 30:40.970
Lu Li.

30:44.450 --> 30:46.590
The key to getting rid of the Soul-Devouring Spell

30:46.590 --> 30:48.110
is yourself.

30:49.950 --> 30:50.920
It's because

30:52.100 --> 30:53.630
it doesn't allow me to love.

30:56.340 --> 30:57.140
Yes.

30:57.430 --> 30:58.690
The deeper the love is,

31:00.290 --> 31:01.620
the more pain you are in.

31:02.550 --> 31:04.320
Your fluttering heart,

31:06.080 --> 31:06.800
your love,

31:09.150 --> 31:10.480
and your longing for her

31:14.520 --> 31:16.410
are all burning your life.

31:25.990 --> 31:26.790
You and her...

31:29.470 --> 31:30.310
It should be

31:34.980 --> 31:37.790
love...

31:40.560 --> 31:41.780
I understand now.

31:44.760 --> 31:45.520
Lu Li,

31:46.360 --> 31:48.580
I can only suppress the Soul-Devouring Spell for a while.

31:48.580 --> 31:49.930
If you are badly injured,

31:49.930 --> 31:52.780
or the one who cast the spell triggers the spell and breaks the restriction,

31:52.780 --> 31:55.180
the backlash will lead you to death faster.

32:02.150 --> 32:02.750
All right.

32:04.330 --> 32:05.790
You should be fine for now.

32:06.180 --> 32:07.270
Be careful.

32:08.240 --> 32:10.500
Don't trigger the backlash of the spell.

32:15.210 --> 32:16.510
Don't worry, He Na.

32:16.510 --> 32:18.370
I will find a way to solve the spell

32:18.530 --> 32:19.790
for Liu Shao.

32:20.330 --> 32:23.610
[Marquis Wuyang's Mansion]

32:26.760 --> 32:28.620
-Senior, hello. -Senior, hello.

32:30.370 --> 32:31.550
Hello.

32:39.530 --> 32:40.070
Boss,

32:40.070 --> 32:41.540
I think you are Lord Wuxiang

32:41.540 --> 32:42.680
in my mind.

32:42.680 --> 32:44.400
I'll always be your follower.

32:45.620 --> 32:48.420
-Hello, Senior Liu Shao. -Hello, Senior Liu Shao.

32:53.260 --> 32:53.810
Is she the one?

32:53.810 --> 32:55.940
Yes, the one that Lord Wuxiang values.

33:12.370 --> 33:14.030
Why is everyone looking at me?

33:14.260 --> 33:15.270
Am I weird?

33:15.770 --> 33:17.120
Guess it.

33:17.120 --> 33:18.170
-I guess? -Liu Shao.

33:18.170 --> 33:19.090
Lord Liu,

33:19.930 --> 33:22.530
this is specially prepared for you.

33:22.530 --> 33:23.790
What did you call me?

33:23.790 --> 33:25.310
Lord Liu?

33:25.770 --> 33:26.860
Yes, Liu Shao.

33:26.860 --> 33:29.000
You are valued by Lord Wuxiang.

33:29.000 --> 33:30.680
All of us,

33:30.680 --> 33:31.610
everyone,

33:31.610 --> 33:32.700
including Marquis Wuyang,

33:32.700 --> 33:34.760
we have never formally talked to him.

33:34.880 --> 33:35.760
He is

33:35.760 --> 33:37.820
the immortal you've been looking for, right?

33:37.820 --> 33:39.120
Can you tell me

33:39.120 --> 33:41.940
whether Lord Wuxiang is friendly?

33:41.940 --> 33:44.070
He is definitely not as friendly as me.

33:45.210 --> 33:46.260
Friendly?

33:49.540 --> 33:52.820
He is not friendly at all.

33:53.870 --> 33:54.660
Let me tell you.

33:54.660 --> 33:55.880
He

33:55.880 --> 33:57.350
haggles over every ounce

33:57.350 --> 33:59.370
and likes money, right?

33:59.910 --> 34:01.050
Money?

34:01.050 --> 34:03.510
He haggles over every ounce and likes money?

34:03.900 --> 34:05.410
People in the Immortal Palace don't need money.

34:05.410 --> 34:05.880
Right?

34:05.880 --> 34:08.190
I also think that people in the Immortal Palace don't like money.

34:08.190 --> 34:09.780
But Lord Wuxiang

34:09.780 --> 34:10.920
is different from others.

34:10.920 --> 34:13.810
He has a special fetish.

34:13.810 --> 34:15.580
You know, the fetish...

34:17.800 --> 34:18.690
Are you okay?

34:19.190 --> 34:19.989
What's wrong?

34:21.040 --> 34:22.380
I sprained my ankle.

34:22.380 --> 34:22.760
Come on.

34:22.760 --> 34:23.469
Hurry up.

34:23.469 --> 34:24.600
Come out and move it.

34:25.360 --> 34:26.080
Come on.

34:26.080 --> 34:26.960
Get up.

34:27.250 --> 34:28.179
Let's go.

34:30.449 --> 34:33.310
Even a Lord can sprain her ankle when she is sitting.

34:37.880 --> 34:39.770
Don't get carried away.

34:39.770 --> 34:41.909
Do you know you almost revealed it?

34:41.909 --> 34:42.630
Really?

34:44.100 --> 34:45.020
Of course.

34:48.130 --> 34:49.929
Look at how smug you are.

34:49.929 --> 34:50.940
This is not right.

34:53.130 --> 34:54.340
Didn't you say that

34:54.340 --> 34:56.190
you've seen a lot of things?

34:56.949 --> 34:58.540
It is just Lord Luo Ge.

34:59.000 --> 35:01.130
Is it necessary for you to be like this?

35:02.280 --> 35:03.880
Of course not.

35:06.020 --> 35:07.530
I just don't understand

35:09.130 --> 35:11.650
why Immortal Wanwu didn't expose you.

35:12.820 --> 35:14.210
Or

35:14.210 --> 35:15.470
do you know each other?

35:16.220 --> 35:17.230
To be honest,

35:18.110 --> 35:19.250
I'm not sure either.

35:19.840 --> 35:20.930
Could it be that

35:20.930 --> 35:22.730
there is something

35:23.450 --> 35:25.580
between my master and Immortal Wanwu?

35:26.220 --> 35:27.310
Or

35:29.080 --> 35:30.610
Immortal Wanwu thinks that

35:31.810 --> 35:34.750
I look like a lord and have an immortal aura,

35:34.750 --> 35:36.750
and wants to take me as his disciple.

35:39.910 --> 35:41.090
Immortal aura?

35:41.470 --> 35:43.400
You were a liar when I met you.

35:43.400 --> 35:44.410
You're still a liar now.

35:44.410 --> 35:45.880
No immortal aura at all.

35:45.880 --> 35:46.590
Don't I have an Immortal aura?

35:46.590 --> 35:48.060
You don't have an immortal aura at all.

35:48.060 --> 35:49.490
I think I have.

35:49.490 --> 35:51.040
You like it.

35:51.380 --> 35:52.510
Just make do with it.

35:57.260 --> 35:58.940
What are you looking at?

35:59.520 --> 36:00.450
Nothing.

36:00.450 --> 36:01.460
We like candies.

36:01.460 --> 36:03.180
Sour and sweet candies.

36:13.470 --> 36:16.240
[Immortal Palace, Palace Chonghua]

36:26.110 --> 36:27.240
Immortal Wanwu.

36:28.340 --> 36:30.730
Lingqi, why are you here?

36:31.150 --> 36:34.350
I heard that Luo Ge appeared in Marquis Wu Yang's mansion.

36:35.310 --> 36:37.910
But he has been in seclusion for more than 20 years.

36:37.910 --> 36:39.170
When did he come out?

36:39.170 --> 36:40.730
He didn't.

36:41.150 --> 36:44.880
[Lord in Immortal Palace, Xie Lingqi]

36:42.700 --> 36:44.800
Then what about the Luo Ge

36:45.350 --> 36:46.480
in the Human Realm?

36:49.000 --> 36:51.940
Luo Ge is born with feelingless talents.

36:51.940 --> 36:53.410
He is the only immortal

36:53.410 --> 36:57.060
who has the chance to become a deity.

36:57.990 --> 36:59.160
His theurgy

36:59.160 --> 37:02.480
is not something ordinary cultivators can reach.

37:02.770 --> 37:05.380
He's in seclusion. That's right.

37:05.710 --> 37:09.330
It's also right that he appeared in the human world.

37:10.000 --> 37:12.310
Everything has its will.

37:12.310 --> 37:14.490
Don't think too much about it.

37:14.490 --> 37:17.140
Just wait for him to come out.

37:18.570 --> 37:20.160
The Immortal Palace

37:20.160 --> 37:22.090
and even the whole Three Realms,

37:22.680 --> 37:26.710
can only rely on Luo Ge in the future.

37:33.480 --> 37:37.550
[Marquis Wuyang's Mansion]

37:36.540 --> 37:37.470
Things happen

37:37.470 --> 37:38.640
one after another.

37:39.270 --> 37:41.200
I don't have time to find King Herb.

37:41.620 --> 37:43.300
If I still can't find King Herb,

37:43.300 --> 37:44.310
and others know that Marquis Wuyang lost most of his power

37:44.310 --> 37:45.700
because he saved me,

37:46.030 --> 37:48.090
the Human Realm will be in big trouble.

37:48.090 --> 37:48.800
Liu Shao

37:48.800 --> 37:49.640
can't

37:49.640 --> 37:51.240
stay in the mansion anymore.

37:56.410 --> 37:58.040
Since the King Herb Demon King in White owns

37:58.040 --> 37:58.930
has been used,

38:01.870 --> 38:03.290
I need to find a way.

38:06.700 --> 38:07.280
Lu Li,

38:08.920 --> 38:10.310
at this point,

38:10.940 --> 38:13.070
you're still thinking about Liu Shao.

38:18.960 --> 38:19.720
It seems that

38:21.270 --> 38:23.580
you've forgotten what I said.

38:25.050 --> 38:25.650
I dare not.

38:26.730 --> 38:28.590
In your opinion, Ao Hen is a demon.

38:29.210 --> 38:30.810
I think Liu Shao is the demon.

38:32.530 --> 38:34.420
You are obsessed with her.

38:35.340 --> 38:36.870
Not only did you disobey me,

38:37.570 --> 38:39.960
you even disregarded your own life.

38:39.960 --> 38:40.420
Master,

38:41.180 --> 38:42.770
you asked me to protect Liu Shao at that time.

38:42.770 --> 38:43.700
Now she's in danger.

38:43.700 --> 38:45.040
How can I ignore her?

38:45.040 --> 38:45.800
But have you forgotten

38:45.800 --> 38:46.970
the real purpose of protecting her

38:46.970 --> 38:49.370
is to let her help you pull out the Moon Sword

38:50.670 --> 38:52.430
rather than risking your life

38:52.430 --> 38:53.360
to love her.

38:59.190 --> 39:02.010
I have warned you not to fall in love with Liu Shao.

39:04.280 --> 39:06.680
The Soul-Devouring Spell has become this.

39:06.750 --> 39:09.110
Do you want to harm yourself or her?

39:09.480 --> 39:09.950
Master.

39:11.290 --> 39:12.620
Master, don't be angry.

39:12.760 --> 39:14.360
Liu Shao is not sensible.

39:14.690 --> 39:16.460
She doesn't understand the love between boys and girls.

39:16.460 --> 39:17.120
She just...

39:17.340 --> 39:19.520
treated me as a bodyguard she employed.

39:19.520 --> 39:20.280
This is only

39:20.870 --> 39:22.270
my own wishful thinking.

39:22.840 --> 39:23.300
Master,

39:23.970 --> 39:25.440
this has nothing to do with Liu Shao.

39:25.440 --> 39:27.170
Please don't take it out on her.

39:42.410 --> 39:44.760
What wishful thinking!

39:50.390 --> 39:51.230
Kneel!

39:53.950 --> 39:54.760
Master.

39:57.190 --> 39:57.950
Li,

39:58.660 --> 40:00.850
since you don't listen to me,

40:02.530 --> 40:04.250
you'll be punished.

40:08.870 --> 40:09.460
Lu Li,

40:10.170 --> 40:10.970
remember,

40:12.230 --> 40:14.580
I won't allow you to make any mistakes.

40:16.180 --> 40:18.380
The effect of the Soul-Devouring Spell

40:18.780 --> 40:20.800
will only make you suffer more.

40:26.510 --> 40:28.530
The magic of He Na

40:28.530 --> 40:31.060
can't stop Master from triggering the spell.

40:44.820 --> 40:46.160
If you are badly injured,

40:46.160 --> 40:49.060
or the one who cast the spell triggers the spell and breaks the restriction,

40:49.060 --> 40:51.460
the backlash will lead you to death faster.

41:04.810 --> 41:05.320
Lu Li!

41:07.710 --> 41:08.210
Lu Li!

41:09.010 --> 41:09.560
Lu Li!

41:19.180 --> 41:20.640
Soul-Devouring Spell...

41:21.990 --> 41:23.590
It's Soul-Devouring Spell.

41:25.350 --> 41:25.900
Liu Shao.

41:27.320 --> 41:27.790
Lu Li,

41:28.080 --> 41:30.260
how deep is your love for Liu Shao?

41:40.050 --> 41:41.250
Senior, stop asking.

41:41.850 --> 41:43.580
This has nothing to do with you.

41:44.250 --> 41:45.450
Nothing to do with me?

41:45.680 --> 41:46.940
What do you mean?

41:47.310 --> 41:49.830
Do you know since you gave me malt candy

41:50.250 --> 41:52.350
and said you would protect me that year,

41:52.350 --> 41:54.160
you've been in my heart?

42:00.880 --> 42:02.180
Actually, I've always...

42:02.180 --> 42:04.660
But I'm not in your heart at all.

42:08.700 --> 42:09.330
I...

42:10.500 --> 42:11.830
I've always treated you

42:12.050 --> 42:13.490
as my own sister.

42:13.690 --> 42:15.490
I have never had other thoughts.

42:15.790 --> 42:16.360
If...

42:16.710 --> 42:17.810
If I

42:17.810 --> 42:20.280
did anything that made you misunderstand me,

42:20.280 --> 42:21.420
I apologize.

42:23.350 --> 42:24.020
Apologize?

42:25.160 --> 42:26.920
I've put my heart, soul,

42:26.920 --> 42:28.310
and so many feelings into you.

42:28.310 --> 42:29.780
Can it be ended

42:29.780 --> 42:30.910
by a simple apology?

42:31.240 --> 42:32.710
You are treating me like this

42:32.710 --> 42:34.060
because of Liu Shao?

42:36.280 --> 42:37.680
No matter what you think,

42:38.550 --> 42:39.940
I won't give up.

42:40.900 --> 42:41.580
Also,

42:42.330 --> 42:44.770
no one can interpose between us.
